# Blender 3D modeling workshop

This project is used **only** to produce 3D models in Blender via the official Blender
MCP extension and the skill pack in `.cursor/skills/`.

- Read `AGENTS.md` at the project root before any work. It is the operating manual.
- Run `python scripts/preflight.py`, then verify MCP with `get_objects_summary`.
- Every request gets its own folder: `Models/<subject-slug>/` (use
  `python scripts/new_model.py <slug>`).
- Read `blender-director` and the relevant discipline/style SKILL.md files before modeling.
- One Blender unit = one meter. `SM_` / `MAT_` / `COL_` naming. Save at every phase gate.
- Never claim a model, render, or export that does not exist on disk.
- Do not add web apps, docs sites, or unrelated code to this folder.
